<title>USA: WebSecure Inc faces securities fraud suit.</title>
<headline>WebSecure Inc faces securities fraud suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The law firm of Abbey, Gardy &amp; Squitieri, LLP said Friday that it has filed a securities fraud suit against  WebSecure charging it with filing a registration statement in connection with its initial public offering containing false and misleading information.</p>
<p>The firm also charged that WebSecure omitted to disclose material facts concerning software technology acquired by it, its revenues, and Centennial Technologies Inc, identified in the registration statement as a related party.</p>
<p>The suit seeks to recover damages on behalf of the plaintiff and all purchasers of WebSecure's securities during a specified period of time.</p>
<p>WebSecure was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
